#. Target volume. Stored on the 89 dB scale and shown on the
#. selected mode's scale, so one offset carries across modes:
#. 95 dB in RG 1.0 is -12 LUFS in RG 2.0 (issues #272, #364).
#: src/ui/toolbar.rs:76
